    },
    "body": "The joint context fit regressed complete replies, and exact family isolation implicated changed context. Add bounded native direction diagnostics to the existing Rust source realizer: recompute credit, fix at most two coordinates, export/reload both legal quarter neighbors, assert exactly one packed coefficient changes and all readouts remain fixed, and retain native masses/trajectories plus every generated reply.\n\nThe first diagnostic finds a category direction that lowers full-answer loss only at later correct prefixes, leaving all eight construction replies unchanged. The successor moves credit to each actual first generated error. There, improving root/category directions lower native frontier CE from2.084871 to2.070434/2.034711, and the opposite directions worsen it. All four retain20 original replies; construction remains0/8 and no greedy frontier winner changes. Retain all candidates; this is functional local credit evidence, not solved attention or general chat.\n\nUpdate the roadmap to a bounded native-screened observation learner. Candidates within a round must share frozen incumbent error prefixes; refresh only after acceptance, retain full-answer/row tradeoffs, and handle completed cases with the offline oracle EOS position. This learner is NOT_RUN. Retained dependent-read components stay on the integration path; no session/runtime model change or uncontrolled joint fit.\n\nValidation: exact committed sources8499adc5/0cbc99b3,14/16 focused example tests and release builds; native runs18.244s/16.211s on Linux x86 CPU. Independent source review and saved arithmetic checks cover1,780 canonical positions,1,426 generated steps,72 credit positions and40 frontier reads, exact exp/Q31/aliases/prefixes/selection/source-packed identities.228 returned files778,465,719B verified. Initial033c2183 compile error retained, repaired before model execution. Rustfmt, diff and claim-wording checks pass. Metal unavailable/not counted; compatibility CI acknowledgements are not tests. No GPU, GitHub research runner or laptop model CPU. Complete work charged once110min conservative envelope, separate from worker timings.\n\nReferences #1552 and #1512.\n",
